5. VoiceOver reads all labels correctly

## Why This Is Asked
This question tests the ability to combine network I/O with offline resilience in a beginner iOS app—a common mobile development pattern that demonstrates practical understanding of data persistence and error handling.

## Key Concepts
- SwiftUI List views and state management with @State
- async/await patterns with URLSession
- Codable protocol for JSON parsing and serialization
- FileManager for Documents directory caching
- Time-to-live (TTL) cache implementation
- Offline fallback strategies and robust error handling

